<title>UK: TENNIS-STATISTICS OF SEMIFINAL BETWEEN SAMPRAS AND WOODBRIDGE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-STATISTICS OF SEMIFINAL BETWEEN SAMPRAS AND WOODBRIDGE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics of the semifinal match</p>
<p>between Pete Sampras (U.S.) and Todd Woodbridge (Australia) at</p>
<p>Wimbledon on Friday:</p>
<p>Sampras won 6-2 6-1 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Time: one hour 44 minutes</p>
<p>				  Sampras   Woodbridge</p>
<p>Aces				  10	  4</p>
<p>Double faults			0	  3</p>
<p>Percentage first serves in    62	 62</p>
<p>Percentage unreturned serves  33	 23</p>
<p>Forehand winners		   5	 10</p>
<p>Backhand winners		   6	  7</p>
<p>Volley winners		    10	  7</p>
<p>Passing winners		    4	  6</p>
<p>Return winners		     5	  5</p>
<p>Percentage returns in	   72	 63</p>
<p>Break points			 8	  6</p>
<p>Break points won		   5	  1</p>
</text>
